OL,5,G0635 Farming Today This Week
OL,6,     FThe UK's biggest champion of
OL,7,     Forganic food is to withhold its
OL,8,     Fapproval of organic salmon.
OL,9,G0700 Today
OL,10,G0900 Saturday Live
OL,11,     FAdrian Chiles presents Radio 4's
OL,12,     Fmorning programme with
OL,13,     Fextraordinary stories and
OL,14,     Fremarkable people.
OL,15,G1000 Curious Cases
OL,16,     F7/13. Chimps and humans are
OL,17,     Fremarkably similar when it comes
OL,18,     Fto genetics but this week we
OL,19,     Finvestigate what would happen if
OL,20,     Feach was raised by the other
